stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NORMAL
  NORMAL --> STEERING: on-prem publishers >= threshold
  STEERING --> STEERING_BURST: steering enabled and publisher load remains high
  STEERING_BURST --> RECOVERING: on-prem publishers recover
  RECOVERING --> STEERING: burst_off complete
  STEERING --> NORMAL: steering_off after burst disabled

  note right of STEERING
    Viewer path moves first:
    hls.example.com on-prem -> CDN
  end note

  note right of STEERING_BURST
    New RTMP sessions move after steering:
    stream.example.com on-prem -> AWS burst
  end note
